---
<section class="py-32 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <h2 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight mb-6">
        Verified privacy.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-copy-15 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Verify your active student status securely. The platform processes credentials to confirm enrollment, but separates verification from your persona and activities entirely.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column (No boxes, pure typographic list) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-1.5">Verification Hashing</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Student email addresses are checked for eligibility, hashed for rate-limiting, and immediately discarded. Raw email data is never saved or linked to posts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-1.5">Zero Identity Logs</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          No names, student numbers, IP logs, or browser metadata are saved in our database. Your activity is completely disassociated from your real identity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-1.5">Encrypted Conversations</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          All messaging history, discussions, and event bookings are encrypted. Access is protected by session tokens, keeping student history secure.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
